WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.297 --> 00:00:22.125
This is what Matdo Check shows the very first time it opens.

2
00:00:22.125 --> 00:00:24.485
Step one is your center.

3
00:00:24.485 --> 00:00:34.376
Type the name families will see on the kiosk.

4
00:00:34.376 --> 00:00:39.347
Then pick your timezone.

5
00:00:39.347 --> 00:00:46.468
This matters: “today” is worked out in the center’s timezone, not the iPad’s.

6
00:00:46.468 --> 00:00:52.071
Tap Continue.

7
00:00:52.071 --> 00:00:56.197
Step two is the instructor PIN.

8
00:00:56.197 --> 00:01:02.942
Six digits, and not an obvious one.

9
00:01:02.942 --> 00:01:09.369
Type it again to confirm.

10
00:01:09.369 --> 00:01:15.775
Leave Face ID on if your instructors are enrolled on this iPad.

11
00:01:15.775 --> 00:01:21.527
Tap Set PIN.

12
00:01:21.527 --> 00:01:26.983
Now the important screen: your recovery code.

13
00:01:26.983 --> 00:01:32.632
Write it down and keep it away from the iPad.

14
00:01:32.632 --> 00:01:39.675
It is the only way into your iCloud backups if the PIN is ever lost.

15
00:01:39.675 --> 00:01:52.800
Tick the box, then tap Continue. Setup is done.
